value semantics.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290400\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291249\n", "files": ["dom/xslt/xpath/txForwardContext.h"], "git_node": "dff3d3391cd6540261d4f5ef930041b3dd05f465", "git_parents": ["194f4e1315b9f5c80eb079a5157828678ffec223"], "node": "2d30524a7d1e8fb10ec5e141d77d5de7211a544b", "parents": ["661a0e16f89bf32c29773298e787560ba19c3cb9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon Farre \u003csimon.farre.cx@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025971 - Use txSingleNodeContext getter of owned txXPathNode  a=diannaS\n\neContext gets a copy of aNode. The function should use that one's member\nas it's not a shared reference, which we can't know the life time of.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290389\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291250\n", "files": ["dom/xslt/xpath/txPathExpr.cpp"], "git_node": "80f9e0d7972f214a29902e7fcea429ecb60dd5df", "git_parents": ["dff3d3391cd6540261d4f5ef930041b3dd05f465"], "node": "c7f72f98fd55fd05ba21c38a83517a2489dee809", "parents": ["2d30524a7d1e8fb10ec5e141d77d5de7211a544b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1775180837, "git_changesets": ["f949ceab1a1e54099c84bf5f39923ec9628fa8bb", "194f4e1315b9f5c80eb079a5157828678ffec223", "dff3d3391cd6540261d4f5ef930041b3dd05f465", "80f9e0d7972f214a29902e7fcea429ecb60dd5df"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "777": {"changesets": [{"author": "Byron Campen \u003cdocfaraday@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2021769: Simplify the CC setup for these classes.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291283\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/RTCEncodedAudioFrame.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/RTCEncodedAudioFrame.h", "dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/RTCEncodedFrameBase.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/RTCEncodedFrameBase.h", "dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/RTCEncodedVideoFrame.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsap