marked as deleted.  a=RyanVM\n\nThis is more consistent with `UnmappedArgGetter` and better handles the case where\nthe property was marked deleted in `RareArgumentsData` but not actually deleted from\nthe object due to OOM. Unfortunately this scenario is hard to prevent because the property\nis marked as deleted in the `ArgumentsObject::obj_delProperty` class hook and after that\n`NativeDeleteProperty` tries to remove the property and this can fail.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292409\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292695\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/arguments/bug2029316.js", "js/src/vm/ArgumentsObject.cpp"], "git_node": "65e71f248fc628bba26ca165e4f75617730bf40c", "git_parents": ["c04ec279ae0924a4cdbadf3bb96d8ed76680444e"], "node": "a921789a19659640d079bcf68c605d09948bcc0e", "parents": ["d1889a31c0db5a1359739ed46b9ff665398eda42"], "tags": []}], "date": 1775695415, "git_changesets": ["65e71f248fc628bba26ca165e4f75617730bf40c"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "863": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jeff Muizelaar \u003cjmuizelaar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2026306 - Fix reporting in ShaderValidatorResults::SizeOfIncludingThis.   a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nThis avoids reporting interior pointers for the vectors.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289869\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292988\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLShaderValidator.cpp"], "git_node": "3985721f45da29adac470a7aa25ba7a35547b4bc", "git_parents": ["65e71f248fc628bba26ca165e4f75617730bf40c"], "node": "f1e0969fb8812147f3878b6885646862cbb0b6e5", "parents": ["a921789a19659640d079bcf68c605d09948bcc0e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1775702610, "git_changesets": ["3985721f45da29adac470a7aa25ba7a35547b4bc"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "864": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default"