ttps://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293635\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293979\n", "files": ["dom/media/webcodecs/AudioData.cpp"], "git_node": "1e60fdadcdbef96e70c16d9d8848b7b221c78354", "git_parents": ["15333a50169c462863f54464e3a78ba15b3e48b8"], "node": "fffb444ecfc0d4af12e6e0c6b63627bf7c7e19d6", "parents": ["3d1dbdfe7744fc9892291c99187529d5810a48b5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025883 - Fix AudioData.copyTo() interleaved-to-interleaved incorrect frame offset calculation.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290717\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293980\n", "files": ["dom/media/webcodecs/AudioData.cpp"], "git_node": "fca5960955b85d1e341086fd5d90e6afc5beb7ee", "git_parents": ["1e60fdadcdbef96e70c16d9d8848b7b221c78354"], "node": "7f31648bd49500404c7339505c7401b06311f77a", "parents": ["fffb444ecfc0d4af12e6e0c6b63627bf7c7e19d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025883 - Fix AudioData.copyTo() planar-to-interleaved not applying frame offset.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290718\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293981\n", "files": ["dom/media/webcodecs/AudioData.cpp"], "git_node": "c797207d82d8a22b0a9fa7e82ed4f7c66f84e17d", "git_parents": ["fca5960955b85d1e341086fd5d90e6afc5beb7ee"], "node": "42500e9d7a712291256172465cba9178a61998ee", "parents": ["7f31648bd49500404c7339505c7401b06311f77a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776120580, "git_changesets": ["cf2e7fa217d89e8249169badd24366ec9a4c1e4f", "15333a50169c462863f54464e3a78ba15b3e48b8", "1e60fdadcdbef96e70c16d9d8848b7b221c78354", "fca5960955b85d1e341086fd5d90e6afc5beb7ee", "c797207d82d8a22b0a9fa7e82ed4f7c66f84e17d"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "962": {"changesets": [{"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2031033 - upgrade NSS to NSS_3_112_4_RTM.  UPGRADE_NSS_RELEASE  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294037\n", "files": ["security/nss/cpputil/nss_scoped_ptrs.h", "security/nss/doc/rst/releases/nss_3_112_4.rst", "security/nss/gtests/der_gtest/der_gtest.gyp", "security/nss/gtests/der_gtest/p12_import_unittest.cc", "security/nss/gtests/der_gtest/p7_import_unittest.cc", "security/nss/gtests/mozpkix_gtest/pkixnames_tests.cpp", "security/nss/gtests/ssl_gtest/ssl_certificate_compression_unittest.cc", "security/nss/lib/certdb/alg1485.c", "security/nss/lib/certdb/stanpcertdb.c", "security/nss/lib/certhigh/certvfy.c", "security/nss/lib/cryptohi/dsautil.c", "security/nss/lib/freebl/blapii.h", "security/nss/lib/freebl/rsa_blind.c", "security/nss/lib/freebl/rsapkcs.c", "security/nss/lib/mozpkix/lib/pkixnames.cpp", "security/nss/lib/nss/nss.h", "security/nss/lib/pk11wrap/pk11pk12.c", "security/nss/lib/pkcs7/p7decode.c", "security/nss/lib/pki/tdcache.c", "security/nss/lib/smime/cmsdecode.c", "security/nss/lib/smime/cmspubkey.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/softkver.h", "security/nss/lib/ssl/dtlscon.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/ssl3con.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/ssl3ext.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/ssl3ext.h", "security/nss/lib/ssl/ssl3exthandle.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/tls13con.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/tls13ech.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/tls13exthandle.c", "security/nss/lib/util/nssutil.h", "security/nss/lib/util/quickder.c", "security/nss/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "2be25fa60338e4c9afd22946d65b3618f6d8bcba", "git_parents": ["c797207d82d8a22b0a9fa7e82ed4f7c66f84e17d"], "node": "129a3ca7b483f8ae18123f83b361cd4e567430b6", "parents": ["42500e9d7a712291256172465cba9178a61998ee"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776122721, "git_changesets": ["2be25fa60338e4c9afd22946d65b3618f6d8bcba"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "963": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029754 - Check chunk to be decommitted is still in the empty chunks list  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThe problem is that we release the GC lock between decommitting chunks, at\nwhich point the chunk can be reused for something else.\n\nThis doesn't generally happen because prior to this decommit loop we free\nchunks in excess of the minimum empty chunk count which is set to 1 chunk by\ndefault, so the loop unsually only has one iteration.\n\nSince the list size is expected to be (very) small the contains check is OK.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292496\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294115\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/GC.cpp", "js/src/gc/GCRuntime.h", "js/src/gc/Heap.cpp"], "git_node": "02c7ba25be2fef6ab4a9a1ec5f407e90b63b7dfc", "git_parents": ["2be25fa60338e4c9afd22946d65b3618f6d8bcba"], "node": "0b9f28466e895caed734303f22385a3c75ed995f", "parents": ["129a3ca7b483f8ae18123f83b361cd4e567430b6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776165053, "git_changesets": ["02c7ba25be2fef6ab4a9a1ec5f407e90b63b7dfc"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "964": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029728 - Check subroutine offset in private dict.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293737\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293887\n", "files": ["gfx/cairo/cairo/src/cairo-cff-subset.c"], "git_node": "6c556b24609c63f0b918c2b930294fc7991fc523", "git_parents": ["02c7ba25be2fef6ab4a9a1ec5f407e90b63b7dfc"], "node": "9fd93048cc090e725cf7d780d15c2b52d3b2c665", "parents": ["0b9f28466e895caed734303f22385a3c75ed995f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776165594, "git_changesets": ["6c556b24609c63f0b918c2b930294fc7991fc523"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "965": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029707: add a length check  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293166\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293899\n", "files": ["netwerk/streamconv/converters/mozTXTToHTMLConv.cpp"], "git_node": "84bfe1e68ab8a7c02853609b518dbafc242cfb12", "git_parents": ["6c556b24609c63f0b918c2b930294fc7991fc523"], "node": "f71902495b0b82bf0862212bf3a8440fcf9c5b7d", "parents": ["9fd93048cc090e725cf7d780d15c2b52d3b2c665"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776165737, "git_changesets": ["84bfe1e68ab8a7c02853609b518dbafc242cfb12"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "966": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025461: Tweak the GMPUtils, fix LOG  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293971\n", "files": ["dom/media/gmp/GMPUtils.cpp", "dom/media/gmp/GMPUtils.h", "dom/media/gmp/GMPVideoEncodedFrameImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "52570386ecbd3b6368d27aca29437fd0cdaa34b2", "git_parents": ["84bfe1e68ab8a7c02853609b518dbafc242cfb12"], "node": "29ddcdba6485eb25a88c32c1682e6ed80e0c0e28", "parents": ["f71902495b0b82bf0862212bf3a8440fcf9c5b7d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776166823, "git_changesets": ["52570386ecbd3b6368d27aca29437fd0cdaa34b2"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "967": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025515 - Use MediaStreamRenderer with video tracks from a single graph. r=karlt a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294064\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLMediaElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLMediaElement.h"], "git_node": "95d25ea73760accd8a5aaf6c69b7572afa08eeef", "git_parents": ["52570386ecbd3b6368d27aca29437fd0cdaa34b2"], "node": "05f44955e48e7dc2bb3f6b33dbc974c209d04fa7", "parents": ["29ddcdba6485eb25a88c32c1682e6ed80e0c0e28"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776167506, "git_changesets": ["95d25ea73760accd8a5aaf6c69b7572afa08eeef"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "968": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028627 - [esr140] Cache generation in gfxPlatformFontList.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nAnd make mSharedFontList an atomic ptr, and other fixes.\n\n(Adapted from AI-suggested fixes, see comments 3 & 8.)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294137\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxDWriteFontList.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxFontEntry.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxPlatformFontList.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxPlatformFontList.h", "gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.cpp"], "git_node": "99c8efc8b3613a30876764bda8c45a6fbccce5a5", "git_parents": ["95d25ea73760accd8a5aaf6c69b7572afa08eeef"], "node": "86020a0a53e6c2882366b39afa425a020324c37f", "parents": ["05f44955e48e7dc2bb3f6b33dbc974c209d04fa7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776172252, "git_changesets": ["99c8efc8b3613a30876764bda8c45a6fbccce5a5"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "969": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028525 - Keep CookieStoreNotifier alive during the dispatching of events,  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292816\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294148\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreNotifier.cpp"], "git_node": "866931cd0bf6b884dbb034c4a565908bf0cef512", "git_parents": ["99c8efc8b3613a30876764bda8c45a6fbccce5a5"], "node": "f5cd07c45102f778815e5a8a869774fcf7cd1bd6", "parents": ["86020a0a53e6c2882366b39afa425a020324c37f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776172633, "git_changesets": ["866931cd0bf6b884dbb034c4a565908bf0cef512"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "970": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicol\u00f2 Ribaudo \u003cnribaudo@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1992103 - Align async modules rejection order with fulfillment order (ESR 140)  a=RyanVM\n\nThis patch inverts the order in which we reject promises in\nAsyncModuleExecutionRejected to match AsyncModuleExecutionFulfilled:\nfirst the promise corresponding to the leaf module (the one that throws)\nis rejected, and then its ancestors.\n\nThis change was discussed at the July 2025 TC39 meeting.\n\nSpec PR: https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/3695\ntest262: https://github.com/tc39/test262/pull/4591\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294119\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/Modules.cpp"], "git_node": "70b620c201996781cdaf437d18ca50c0f79530c2", "git_parents": ["866931cd0bf6b884dbb034c4a565908bf0cef512"], "node": "e4d355dcc87a35dab44c953e4367e0a3ccc99a5c", "parents": ["f5cd07c45102f778815e5a8a869774fcf7cd1bd6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Yoshi Cheng-Hao Huang \u003callstars.chh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2027274 - Patch for ESR 140.  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294153\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/AsyncFunction.cpp", "js/src/vm/Modules.cpp", "js/src/vm/Modules.h"], "git_node": "34499c8450bad55cdbc8bb0b1d31861668079e38", "git_parents": ["70b620c201996781cdaf437d18ca50c0f79530c2"], "node": "8944cbfeef2fb7a4b909d92c0e2066f124624f00", "parents": ["e4d355dcc87a35dab44c953e4367e0a3ccc99a5c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Yoshi Cheng-Hao Huang \u003callstars.chh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2027274 - Test for ESR 140.  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294154\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/modules/bug-2027274.js"], "git_node": "3fbd02ea9723eb75feb733d4854617916d9ae64a", "git_parents": ["34499c8450bad55cdbc8bb0b1d31861668079e38"], "node": "6b38a25d241af4dd3258a04e15cac68150a1cba0", "parents": ["8944cbfeef2fb7a4b909d92c0e2066f124624f00"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776174025, "git_changesets": ["70b620c201996781cdaf437d18ca50c0f79530c2", "34499c8450bad55cdbc8bb0b1d31861668079e38", "3fbd02ea9723eb75feb733d4854617916d9ae64a"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "971": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029776 - Cherry-pick upstream libwebrtc commit 77d265670f  a=diannaS\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/77d265670fa7d7f358c86c54704a6e97c27a6005\n       Fix TOCTOU race in RtpVideoSender::OnVideoLayersAllocationUpdated\n\n       RtpVideoSender::OnVideoLayersAllocationUpdated runs on the encoder thread,\n       checks if it's active, and then posts a task to the transport queue to\n       update module status.\n\n       If SetSending(false) is called on the transport queue before the posted\n       task runs, the task would previously re-register modules in PacketRouter\n       even though active_ was false. This lead to dangling pointers in\n       PacketRouter when the RtpVideoSender was destroyed.\n\n       This CL adds an IsActive() check inside the posted task to ensure we don't\n       re-register modules if the sender has been deactivated.\n\n       Bug: chromium:500767595\n       Test: RtpVideoSenderTest.PostTaskRaceDoesNotLeadToDanglingPointer\n       Change-Id: I18827c34bece7f5ebc41d159d9e19e356afbc404\n       Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/462880\n       Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Reviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47384}\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293064\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293802\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/call/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_video_sender.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_video_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/77d265670f.no-op-cherry-pick-msg"], "git_node": "97b9f33137fe51d5b10c2ef30b9b69854e527345", "git_parents": ["3fbd02ea9723eb75feb733d4854617916d9ae64a"], "node": "bfdbf1a16b9463a927dfc1d84cacbbde8b633d1e", "parents": ["6b38a25d241af4dd3258a04e15cac68150a1cba0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776178749, "git_changesets": ["97b9f33137fe51d5b10c2ef30b9b69854e527345"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "972": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029743 - Return strong references to content from ToDOMPoint.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293153\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294199\n", "files": ["accessible/base/TextLeafRange.cpp", "accessible/base/TextLeafRange.h"], "git_node": "97c808c0ea47b6b5b3a278befab7ef04c5c284b2", "git_parents": ["97b9f33137fe51d5b10c2ef30b9b69854e527345"], "node": "72ed0f1a0749d20f85be30d1abdeeb5274e1549d", "parents": ["bfdbf1a16b9463a927dfc1d84cacbbde8b633d1e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776184550, "git_changesets": ["97c808c0ea47b6b5b3a278befab7ef04c5c284b2"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "973": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2027293 - Retrieve and hold editor before calling SetSelectionBoundsAt.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292197\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294207\n", "files": ["accessible/generic/HyperTextAccessible.cpp"], "git_node": "dbf81713519e871b0b1dcea0be206b18e288a0ad", "git_parents": ["97c808c0ea47b6b5b3a278befab7ef04c5c284b2"], "node": "a12bcb0925978ae05fe8fc0810e43986811583a3", "parents": ["72ed0f1a0749d20f85be30d1abdeeb5274e1549d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776184589, "git_changesets": ["dbf81713519e871b0b1dcea0be206b18e288a0ad"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "974": {"changesets": [{"author": "az \u003cazebrowski@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025511 -  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291541\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294198\n", "files": ["dom/media/AsyncLogger.h"], "git_node": "69f4db0dcfc8c382cd9bdf36ac06d89d39c40026", "git_parents": ["dbf81713519e871b0b1dcea0be206b18e288a0ad"], "node": "f6e0541b9d7c9f2dce33d712ec09bcd8e062b055", "parents": ["a12bcb0925978ae05fe8fc0810e43986811583a3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776185757, "git_changesets": ["69f4db0dcfc8c382cd9bdf36ac06d89d39c40026"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "975": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2027237 - Check that embedder doc is managed by same PBrowser.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nAlso prevent cyclical calls to DocAccessibleParent::Destroy in the case of a parent/child cycle.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292204\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294224\n", "files": ["accessible/ipc/DocAccessibleParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": "146a5199058cdc806a679c30ed803b42118d31de", "git_parents": ["69f4db0dcfc8c382cd9bdf36ac06d89d39c40026"], "node": "e0a8c22c124b5f813af130f0959dc8007468ba33", "parents": ["f6e0541b9d7c9f2dce33d712ec09bcd8e062b055"], "tags": []}], "date": 1776188891, "git_changesets": ["146a5199058cdc806a679c30ed803b42118d31de"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "976": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alex Franchuk \u003cafranchuk@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2026650 - Use the prefs file from the crashreport to disable telemetry r=gsvelto a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292422\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/glean.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/lang/langpack.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/main.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/prefs_parser.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/std/fs.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/test.rs"], "git_node": "3feaf63f204